# serializer version: 1
# name: test_from_dict_malformed[builtin_class]
  "The class of the algorithm settings 'builtins.dict' is not a class of settings of a GEMSEO algorithm; it must be the fully qualified name of such a class, e.g. 'gemseo.optimization.SLSQP_Settings'."
# ---
# name: test_from_dict_malformed[builtin_function]
  "The class of the algorithm settings 'math.sqrt' is not a class of settings of a GEMSEO algorithm; it must be the fully qualified name of such a class, e.g. 'gemseo.optimization.SLSQP_Settings'."
# ---
# name: test_from_dict_malformed[class]
  "The class of the algorithm settings 'tests.algorithms.test_algorithm_configuration.NotSettings' is not a class of settings of a GEMSEO algorithm; it must be the fully qualified name of such a class, e.g. 'gemseo.optimization.SLSQP_Settings'."
